ISO-10303-21;
/* Gs204: B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS (degree 1x1, 12-sided prism, r=1, h=2) wrapping the full 360 degrees but whose LAST pole column is the first column displaced radially by 1e-4 instead of identical to it -- 1000x the 1e-7 pole-comparison tolerance, so the surface reports NOT closed in U while being geometrically closed. One ADVANCED_FACE on it carries two distinct, unshared, 1e-4-apart vertical seam-line edges (u=umin and u=umax), a same-face seam-merge candidate pair whose approval depends entirely on detecting the surface's closure without a closure flag to read */
